    "summary": "Added the missing failed-re-read scenario to the claim test: a fake whose addAssignee takes effect and then fails reading the assignees back (failReread). The test asserts the claim is refused with 'claim failed (unreachable): re-read unreachable; the stage state is unknown', that the assignee list is exactly ['alice'] (the add happened, nobody else touched), and that a following claim, reading the stage again, finds it already mine and is allowed. The earlier failed-add, failed-initial-read and contested cases remain.",
